<title>USA: Washoe County, Nev., won by PaineWebber Inc. [CORRECTED 18:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Washoe County, Nev., won by PaineWebber Inc. [CORRECTED 18:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to make clear PaineWebber won the bonds, not Robert W Baird. Also corrects true interest cost from 5.0151 pct.)</p>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said it won $10 million of Washoe County, Nev., limited tax various purpose general obligation bonds, series April 1, 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.9724 percent.</p>
</text>
